    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6c45db5b36d91337f69165d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『为了已故的妹妹献上无二的荣光』——\r\n这是她的目标。要是以这个目标考虑的话，\r\n可选的比赛有年末的『有马纪念』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c54ee1464b856e08fd8e861de0d56fc0b2e9606a90c7c091d100e615b803fc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2381eed20493ad0179a8386",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……还是暂时放一放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "676fa74f6d2c54c71afab945dca5604ee2681e763826bc1e62183833bf800c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
